A '''Farming Toolkit''' is a {{Rare}} item that can be consumed to unlock the '''Farming Toolkit''' menu.

== Obtaining ==
A '''Farming Toolkit''' can be purchased from [[SkyMart]] on {{zone|The Garden}} for {{Copper|500}}.

== Usage ==
A '''Farming Toolkit''' can be consumed once to permanently unlock the '''Farming Toolkit''' menu and gain {{SBXP|2}}.

The '''Farming Toolkit''' menu can be opened in the player's [[Storage]] or with the {{Code|/farmingtoolkit}} command. It can store one of each [[Specialized Farming Tool]].

